  "prefLabel": "Puc 2201.03 Waiver of Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2201.03 Waiver of Rules.\n\n(a) The commission shall consider and determine any request for a waiver from the provisions of these rules pursuant to Puc 201.05.\n\n(b) The commission shall waive the application of any particular rule in this part to a rural electric cooperative for which a certificate of deregulation is on file with the public utilities commission pursuant to RSA 301:57 if it finds upon petition of such a cooperative that compliance is not reasonably practical at a reasonable cost to the cooperative or CPA or CPAs requesting information or services from the cooperative.\n\nSource. #13457, eff 10-12-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc2200.html"
}
